    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18561" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφύη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ἡ</span>
		(gen. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφύων,</span> not <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφυῶν,</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.425.13
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small fry</i> of
			various fishes (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρός</span> III),
				<i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				60
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				89
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				124
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				640
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hices.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.285b
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμβράς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; nickname of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταίρα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.586b
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφύα πῦρ</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδε πῦρ ἀ.</span> 'no sooner said
			than done', <i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				2.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1150.40
			</span></i>.—Not used in sg. by 
				Att.
			, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφύων τιμή.</span>
			</div>
